      "title": "Cost and profit maximization",
      "instruction": "Set the market price and fixed overhead costs. Find the quantity that maximizes firm profit where MR = MC.",
      "explanation": "A competitive price-taking firm maximizes profit where Marginal Revenue equals Marginal Cost (MR = MC). When price exceeds average total cost, the firm earns positive economic profit shown by the profit rectangle."
